1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,717
We already know the two carts cannot
ignore each

2
00:00:03,737 --> 00:00:04,594
other.

3
00:00:04,614 --> 00:00:07,085
That makes this morning a game.

4
00:00:07,105 --> 00:00:08,746
Now name the players.

5
00:00:08,766 --> 00:00:12,898
A player is someone who posts a price this
morning.

6
00:00:12,918 --> 00:00:15,389
The market is not a player.

7
00:00:15,409 --> 00:00:17,880
The weather is not a player.

8
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,310
Here is the idea.

9
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:22,884
A player is someone who posts a price, and
who

10
00:00:22,904 --> 00:00:25,029
cares what the other cart posts.

11
00:00:25,049 --> 00:00:28,961
If it cannot post a price, it is not a
player.

12
00:00:28,981 --> 00:00:31,463
Rain can change how many customers come.

13
00:00:31,483 --> 00:00:34,680
Rain does not put a number on a board.

14
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,815
Look at the three names.

15
00:00:36,835 --> 00:00:38,949
Cart A posts a price.

16
00:00:38,969 --> 00:00:41,084
Cart B posts a price.

17
00:00:41,104 --> 00:00:44,926
Customers look at both boards and walk to
the

18
00:00:44,946 --> 00:00:45,824
cheaper cart.

19
00:00:45,844 --> 00:00:47,958
The customers are the crowd.

20
00:00:47,978 --> 00:00:50,520
They are not a third player.

21
00:00:50,540 --> 00:00:53,690
Someone writes, the market chooses the
winner.

22
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:55,049
Cross that out.

23
00:00:55,069 --> 00:00:57,314
A and B post prices.

24
00:00:57,334 --> 00:00:58,219
Customers walk.

25
00:00:58,239 --> 00:01:03,654
There is no third board on this path, so
there is no

26
00:01:03,674 --> 00:01:04,560
third player.

27
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:09,365
Before you keep a name, ask whether it can
post a

28
00:01:09,385 --> 00:01:10,676
price this morning.

29
00:01:10,696 --> 00:01:12,860
If it cannot, drop it.

30
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:14,171
Two names stay.

31
00:01:14,191 --> 00:01:16,355
Cart A and Cart B.

32
00:01:16,375 --> 00:01:18,539
Next we name the strategies.

33
00:01:18,559 --> 00:01:19,850
High or Low.

